OL,3,GNEWSAStuck hedgehog saved in 'miracle'
OL,4,Awall rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hedgehog which was stuck in a wall is
OL,7,Frecovering from its ordeal after a
OL,8,Frescue described as "nothing short of a
OL,9,Fmiracle" by an animal charity.
OL,11,FAn out of hours ambulance driver for
OL,12,FJSPCA Animals' Shelter managed to get
OL,13,Fthe male hedgehog out a deep cavity in
OL,14,Fa wall in Old St John's Road in St
OL,15,FHelier.
OL,17,FThe charity said the animal was spotted
OL,18,Fby an eagle-eyed passer-by which
OL,19,F"almost certainly saved his life".
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
